------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Why: run 7 gave the Deepgram baseline with the DM alone. Still open: two speakers, a
player stopping, a first-time question, and a first live look at PRs #192 (#188),
#184, #194, #195 (#190), #196, #202, #206 (#107), #207 (#108), #208 (#99), #214
(scene hints), #220 (heard counts), #223 and #226 (name card), and now #241, #244,
