Already confirmed in run 8a: consent carries over, Stop recording me and I consent
again work at once, the download is offered.

Where: cloud test server, Docker Compose, TRANSCRIBER=deepgram (nova-3),
DMBOT_DEBUG_AUDIO=1, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set. Deployed: e299bfc (2026-10-08 18:18 UTC).

Before the test (owner)
  [ ] Tell the server session how many people (1 = DM only, 2 = DM + player, ...);
      paste the matching docs/test-scripts/ script into Discord. If development has
      moved since e299bfc, ask it to redeploy first. Use a steady connection (run 8a
      on bad Wi-Fi got 26% of the audio)
